  "_comment": "Demo accounts for the STAGE server (one of every account type). Copy this file to demo-accounts.json (git-ignored), replace every placeholder phone and example.com email with ones you control (each sign-in is a one-time code sent by SMS to the phone or by email to the address), and delete the _example line. Every person takes a phone, an email or both; lab/clinic owners and staff and a NEW pharmacy need a phone (their records require one), the email is optional. Phones may repeat across roles (a phone with several lab/clinic memberships chooses the workspace after the code). Linked clinic doctors sign in to the clinic workspace with their mobile number; give signInEmail to add an email sign-in there too. Run: SEED_DEMO_ALLOWED=true SEED_DEMO_HOST=<the stage host:port> SEED_DEMO_DATABASE=<the stage database name> npm run seed:demo -- demo-accounts.json   (dry run; it prints the host and database first, and refuses until both match), then the same with --commit.",
